{'symbol': 'FBHS', 'date': '2022-06-16 09:00:00', 'title': 'FIBERON TO SHOWCASE NEW WILDWOOD COMPOSITE CLADDING AT AIA 2022', 'text': "MAUMEE, OHIO , JUNE 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HUNDREDS OF ARCHITECTS, DESIGNERS AND OTHER INDUSTRY PROFESSIONALS WILL GET AN UP-CLOSE LOOK AT FIBERON'S NEW HIGH-PERFORMANCE COMPOSITE CLADDING AT THE AIA CONFERENCE ON ARCHITECTURE 2022, JUNE 22-25 IN CHICAGO. FIBERON WILL SHOWCASE ITS NEW WILDWOOD COMPOSITE CLADDING AT THE 2022 AIA CONFERENCE JUNE 22-25 IN CHICAGO."}